00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.466
and just one quick thing.

00:09:49.466 --> 00:09:51.070
If you're going to events,

00:09:51.070 --> 00:09:53.853
and you want to meet
people, get in there fast.

00:09:53.853 --> 00:09:55.862
You want to go talk to a speaker?

00:09:55.862 --> 00:09:58.704
Be there before the speaker goes on stage.

00:09:58.704 --> 00:10:01.356
You want to have a mentoring session?

00:10:01.356 --> 00:10:03.000
My first mentoring session was empty.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.096
Nobody showed up.

00:10:04.096 --> 00:10:07.189
I spoke with Lily for 45 minutes.

00:10:07.189 --> 00:10:09.693
And then at my next mentoring
session it was all full

00:10:09.693 --> 00:10:12.746
and the next one it's like triple booked

00:10:12.746 --> 00:10:15.790
and getting people wanting
to talk to me on my break

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.821
and walk me to the next thing,

00:10:17.821 --> 00:10:19.312
and it's great, I'm happy to do it,

00:10:19.312 --> 00:10:20.615
I love being fully booked.

00:10:20.615 --> 00:10:22.823
I'm not complaining, I
love it, it fuels me.

00:10:22.823 --> 00:10:24.478
But there were lots of people waiting too,

00:10:24.478 --> 00:10:25.994
who I didn't get to talk to

00:10:25.994 --> 00:10:29.413
and it bothers me because I
had all this free time before.

00:10:29.413 --> 00:10:31.523
And so if there's someone who you want

00:10:31.523 --> 00:10:33.554
to talk to at an event, don't be shy.

00:10:33.554 --> 00:10:35.819
If your goal is to go
there and talk to them,

00:10:35.819 --> 00:10:39.167
get their feedback on something

00:10:39.167 --> 00:10:41.007
that you're dealing with right now.

00:10:41.007 --> 00:10:42.292
Don't be shy. Go say hi.

00:10:42.292 --> 00:10:44.076
Talk to the speaker
before they go on stage

00:10:44.076 --> 00:10:46.386
because they're going to
be bombarded afterwards

00:10:46.386 --> 00:10:49.367
and even if you do get in,
they're only going to have

00:10:49.367 --> 00:10:51.384
a couple minutes because they're swamped,

00:10:51.384 --> 00:10:52.731
there's a huge line up.

00:10:52.731 --> 00:10:54.843
